.
.  Plot for Normal CDF table
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na tpdftb.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE t PDF (Two-Sided Test at Alpha = 0.05)
TITLE OFFSET 3
TITLE SIZE 5
LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
SET X11 HARDWARE FILL OFF
REGION FILL OFF ON ON
REGION BASE 0 ALL
.
PLOT TPDF(X,10) FOR X = -5 0.01 5 AND
PLOT TPDF(X,10) FOR X = -5 0.01 -2.29 AND
PLOT TPDF(X,10) FOR X = 2.29 0.01 5.0
.
font simplex
height 3
movedata 3.0 0.03
text lc()alph() = 0.025
movedata -4.5 0.03
text lc()alph() = 0.025
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp TPDFTB.PS tpdftb.ps
system rm TPDFTB.PS
.
. quit
